{"channelId":"UCIy8kMOq8ADA8y5ytPMf8AA","row":["Volhard Dog Nutrition",6010,"Volhard Dog Nutrition uses dehydration as a method of food preserving which removes the moisture from raw, whole food ingredients. It inhibits the growth of microorganisms. Bacteria, yeasts and molds need water in the food to grow, and drying effectively prevents them from surviving in the food. Simply re-hydrate our foods with warm water and add your dog’s favorite meat.\n\nDo you have a puppy or an older dog? Is your dog active? Or, does your dog prefer relaxing on a pillow? Volhard Dog Nutrition covers all of life’s stages.\n\nEndorsed by America’s top trainers, Volhard Dog Nutrition, uses only human grade, home grown ingredients without preservatives and are completely and proudly made in the U.S.A.\n\nWHOLESOME, HEALTHY, SAFE DOG FOOD TO SUIT ANY LIFESTYLE\n\nhttps://linktr.ee/volharddognutrition\n1-888-571-2245\nwww.VolhardDogNutrition.com\nFacebook.com/VolhardDogNutrition\nInstagram: @VolhardDogNutrition\nTwitter.com/VolhardDogFood\nPinterest.com/volharddognutrition","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIy8kMOq8ADA8y5ytPMf8AA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIy8kMOq8ADA8y5ytPMf8AA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:45.980Z","channelId":"UCIy8kMOq8ADA8y5ytPMf8AA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"98b226834be286ef6c831d4a04b52eb09c689851e1ab531ad98f0173e97cb681","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"feeefd961360d3fc8fe58ddf705d4e266446e012c73624193646b212349a7aaa"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIy8kMOq8ADA8y5ytPMf8AA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:48:10.378Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIy8kMOq8ADA8y5ytPMf8AA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":6010,"raw":"6.01K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIy8kMOq8ADA8y5ytPMf8AA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:45.980Z"}],"ema